    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>run, gun, and blast</strong> through dynamic 3D environments in an all-out action-packed adventure! Pick your favorite mercenary, each armed with unique skills that make every run feel fresh and exhilarating. <strong>Unleash chaos</strong> with a vast arsenal of guns and attacks as you take down waves of relentless enemies and <strong>face off against colossal bosses</strong>. Whether you're going solo or teaming up with 6 friends, get ready for intense 6-player mayhem where smashing and blasting reign supreme!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rent\u2019s due, and our heroes are broke! Join a ragtag team of mercenaries on a bounty-hunting spree through the <strong>highs and lows of a futuristic city</strong>, battling through dangerous jungles and sinister labs to earn their next paycheck. Along the way, they\u2019ll uncover a conspiracy that threatens to reshape the city's future\u2014and their own. Will they save the day and pay rent, or bite off more than they can chew? <strong>Suit up for a wild ride filled with heart, humor, and high-octane action!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>stunning hand-drawn visuals</strong> blended with cutting-edge 3D environments. Every character, enemy, and setting is meticulously designed to keep you hyped from start to finish, complemented by an electrifying soundtrack and <strong>fun, quirky story dialogue</strong> that adds flavor to your journey!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic shoot-'em-up gameplay with a modern twist on the <strong>retro arcade vibe</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully hand-drawn 2D characters seamlessly blended with vibrant 3D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 6-player chaos</strong>\u2014both online and local couch co-op for ultimate multiplayer fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VS Mode - </strong>Had enough of co-op? Say no more! Jump into a brand-new, never-before-seen fighting style in this adrenaline-pumping Stryke-VS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully voiced, story-driven campaign</strong> with memorable characters and witty banter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the top spot on local leaderboards, with more features coming soon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rouge-lite mode</strong> for those craving an extra challenge!<br><br>Be sure to visit our website for support and frequent Demo updates and Wishlist!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun to juggle your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.poster.avif?t=1754233188\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.webm?t=1754233188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.mp4?t=1754233188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
