for ultimate multiplayer fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VS Mode - </strong>Had enough of co-op? Say no more! Jump into a brand-new, never-before-seen fighting style in this adrenaline-pumping Stryke-VS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully voiced, story-driven campaign</strong> with memorable characters and witty banter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the top spot on local leaderboards, with more features coming soon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rouge-lite mode</strong> for those craving an extra challenge!<br><br>Be sure to visit our website for support and frequent Demo updates and Wishlist!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun to juggle your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.poster.avif?t=1754233188\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.webm?t=1754233188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255320/extras/1601882e79f37197f75a14b1ea47017d.mp4?t=1754233188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
